      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Fractional flow reserve (FFR) measurement is still not common practice in invasive cardiology or catheterisation. It has required teams to manage new elements such as the measurement console, the pressure wire, and adenosine injection. Several studies have shown the potential benefits of such a procedure."},
